  "details": "Many couples have met through vrc and playing vrc together. You can do alot and even for long distance relationships then vrc is their only way of virtually be with eachother.\n\nToday you can send a friend request and have your own homes and such. What if there could be a partner request and through that you could share the same homeinstance like if you were living together. It could show as another color of the name than yellow or maybe an icon.\n\nI have also seen alot of wedding worlds and many people get married virtually so why not have that also as an option to show publicly. Maybe through 2 rings above the name or such and have it like a printed name in the bio or something.",
